<title>HUNGARY: RICHTER Q1 1997 IAS NET PROFIT 4.997 BLN.</title>
<headline>RICHTER Q1 1997 IAS NET PROFIT 4.997 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-month period</p>
<p>ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Jan-March 1997   Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Operating profit	   4,322     vs    2,696</p>
<p>    Net profit before tax    4,997     vs    3,258</p>
<p>    Net profit		   4,997     vs    3,258</p>
<p>    Sales			 12,801     vs    9,419</p>
<p>    Cost of sales		4,586     vs    3,583</p>
<p>    Gross profit		 8,215     vs    5,836</p>
<p>    Operating expenses	 3,893     vs    3,140</p>
<p>    Royalty and similar income  32     vs	307</p>
<p>Interest income and</p>
<p>	similar income	     495     vs	294</p>
<p>    Interest expense		 4     vs	 39</p>
<p>    Net other income	     152 (profit) vs   0</p>
<p>NOTE - Richter Gedeon Vegyeszeti Gyar Rt is a</p>
<p>pharmaceuticals company.</p>
<p>The figures were calculated according to International</p>
<p>Accounting Standards. The figures are unaudited.</p>
<p>The earnings report was released in the official gazette of</p>
<p>the Budapest Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
